        <h1 id="promise" class="ln" style="--lt:.55em">One call instead of three.</h1>
        <p class="sub ln"><code>lets</code> replaces <code>cat</code>, <code>grep</code> and <code>sed</code> for your coding agent, and every answer says what it left out.</p>
